1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,135
The pressure built during the second winter, and the price of the good name of the group was suddenly very high.

2
00:00:06,135 --> 00:00:12,479
“We must consider the value of the store as well as the story,” the director said.

3
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:24,422
“A fixed rate is worth less than a fixed habit.” The state, the market, and the social interest were, yet again, in the same room.

4
00:00:24,422 --> 00:00:29,766
The deep problem was that nobody wanted to carry the burden of a withdrawal.

5
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:35,120
“Lay the offer on the table and let them refuse it,” Maya said.

6
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:48,594
“An option that we never offer is an imitation of a choice.” The overwhelming part was the timing: the law required an answer during a week when nobody was in the office.

7
00:00:48,594 --> 00:00:54,178
The cry of the tenants was reasonable and the instinct of the council was not.

8
00:00:54,178 --> 00:01:01,177
“Just because a policy is political does not mean it must be mean,” the treasurer said.

9
00:01:01,177 --> 00:01:06,741
“A rare chance and a smart advance could still meet in the middle.”

10
00:01:06,741 --> 00:01:15,260
The advance they were offered was an addition to the budget with a deep condition attached: an equivalent cut somewhere else.

11
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:19,769
“Do not excuse the burden with a toy,” Lin said.

12
00:01:19,769 --> 00:01:25,134
“The depth of the cut matters more than the height of the promise.”

13
00:01:25,134 --> 00:01:33,927
The fixed sums, the treasure of the archive, and the worthy names on the wall were all counted backward from the result.

14
00:01:33,927 --> 00:01:38,636
“Persistence is not deliberation,” the auditor said.

15
00:01:38,636 --> 00:01:44,981
“A deliberation that inflates the estimate is a gamble with public money.”

16
00:01:44,981 --> 00:01:49,140
The shameful part was the withdrawal of the second audit.

17
00:01:49,140 --> 00:02:02,598
A rouse of hope, an invalid measurement, and a demand for respect: the pressure had produced a decision that nobody could call good, and the group had to decide whether to sign it.

18
00:02:02,598 --> 00:02:09,981
The policy was never just during the meeting, and the money under the political story was not nothing.

19
00:02:09,981 --> 00:02:18,525
The right and the social state had met before; the market, the law, the interest, and the government had all signed.

20
00:02:18,525 --> 00:02:32,103
A bad carry, a fixed miss, a high cry, and a respect that was equal: the price was worth it, and the deep value was in the store, not in the value of the option.

21
00:02:32,103 --> 00:02:40,781
Ahead of the meeting, a fan of the old scheme and a burden of paperwork were laid on the same table.
